      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cuba%2C_New_Mexico"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Cuba hosts the Sandoval County Fair every August, featuring traditional craftsmanship, agricultural products, rodeo, and powwow.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23
